---
source: crates/zaun/src/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_help().to_string()
---
Games installed with Steam (shown when "Show my Steam games" is on)

Usage: zaun steam [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  scan            Read Steam's files now and list what was found (changes nothing)
  on              Show the games installed with Steam in Zaun
  off             Stop showing them (what you set for them is kept)
  update          Open Steam's downloads, where the game's update is started
  open            Show the game in Steam (its properties hold the Proton choice)
  launch-options  Show or change the game's launch options (Steam › Properties › Launch options). Changing them needs Steam to be closed
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose...  Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
  -h, --help        Print help
